        Typed Chain-of-Thought: A Curry-Howard Framework for Verifying <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Perrier%2C+E">Elija Perrier</a>
      
