    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        A Tale of <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span> and Induced Small Proxies: Scalable Small Language Models for Knowledge Mining
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+S">Sipeng Zhang</a>, 
      
